  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Grit::Commit/ef71a4865a5821d8cd24f171a0100156a02e808e</id>
    <link type="text/html" rel="alternate" href="https://github.com/anomalyco/models.dev/commit/ef71a4865a5821d8cd24f171a0100156a02e808e"/>
    <title>
        feat(cline-pass): add glm-5.3-flash (#6053)
    </title>
    <updated>2026-09-04T23:27:31Z</updated>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/423078?s=30&amp;v=4"/>
    <author>
      <name>munim</name>
      <uri>https://github.com/munim</uri>
    </author>
    <content type="html">
      &lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;feat(cline-pass): add glm-5.3-flash (#6053)

* feat(cline-pass): add glm-5.3-flash

glm-5.3-flash is available in ClinePass but missing from the provider
data. Adds providers/cline-pass/models/cline-pass/glm-5.3-flash.toml
with base_model pointing at the existing zhipuai lab entry and
reference pricing matching glm-5.3.

* fix(cline-pass): correct glm-5.3-flash pricing

$0.075 input / $0.25 output per 1M tokens; cache read $0.015.

* fix(cline-pass): glm-5.3-flash actual pricing

$0.15 input / $0.50 output / $0.03 cache read per 1M tokens.

* fix(cline-pass): inline glm-5.3-flash entry

No upstream lab mapping on ClinePass for this slug. Inline the full
model metadata (name/description from the ClinePass catalog, specs
matching Z.ai&amp;#39;s GLM-5.3-Flash) instead of base_model.&lt;/pre&gt;
    </content>
  </entry>
